u can make this work in people  and Africans on it we can make it you  can produce it we have to know that you  have the people do competence you had  everything while the factories  management is in negotiation with the  government  China is offering to supply the drug in  this battle to save lives the death of  pop Jeff has shaken Senegal and millions  of sports fans in France and  french-speaking parts of Africa where  more and more people are falling  critically ill Nicholas Hawk al-jazeera  at the car
 

